{
  "articles": [
    {
      "title": "2026最该读的一本书，没有之一",
      "thumb_media_id": "AePEmFk8ZwibHEAn_R1JIfG6nU_FCTm9DxF04GSisB5wgbvo4DoMA7RXpS3pwRf9",
      "content": "<div style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 40px 10px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; letter-spacing: 0.3px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">大家好，我是马尔斯，书灯笔记的主理人。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">每年 January 1 号，你是不是都会列一张清单：早起、健身、读书、学英语、戒奶茶……然后到了 January 15 号，这张清单就消失了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">不是你意志力不够，是你用错了方法。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">今天想跟你聊聊《掌控习惯》。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">01 每天1%，一年后你会变成谁？</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这本书的作者詹姆斯·克利尔，一开始也不是什么自律达人。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">高中时的一场棒球事故让他脑部受伤，被送进了重症监护室。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">醒来后，他发现自己连最基本的动作都要重新学。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">大学里，他的成绩一塌糊涂，体育生涯也断了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">但他后来成了全美最佳棒球运动员之一，还创办了自己的习惯培训公司。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">他靠的不是什么惊天动地的意志力爆发，而是一个极其简单的公式：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">每天进步 1%，一年后你会变成 1.</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">37 倍的自己。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">反过来，每天退步 1%，一年后你会变成 0.</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">03。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">几乎归零。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这个数学题不难，但大多数人忽略了一个事实：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">习惯的复利效应，在短期内完全看不出来。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 你坚持跑步一周，体重不会变。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你坚持读书一个月，工资不会涨。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你坚持早起三个月，人生也不会突然开挂。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">正因为短期看不到效果，99% 的人在第 7 天就放弃了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">克利尔说了一句很扎心的话：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">&quot;你不会达到你目标的高度，你只会掉到你系统的水平。&quot;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">什么意思？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">目标告诉你&quot;要去哪&quot;，系统告诉你&quot;怎么走&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">光有目标没有系统，就像你买了张机票但没规划路线——你永远到不了。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">02 习惯的四大定律</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">克利尔把养成习惯拆成了四个步骤，每个步骤对应一个策略。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">第一步：让它显而易见。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你想多喝水？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">把水杯放在电脑旁边，而不是厨房里。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你想多读书？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">把书放在枕头边，而不是书架上。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">环境设计比意志力管用一百倍。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 你不需要&quot;决定&quot;去喝水，你只需要看到水杯，顺手就拿起来了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">我自己试过：把吉他从柜子里拿出来，放在沙发旁边。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">之前一个月摸不了两次，现在每天下班回家都会弹几分钟。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">吉他没变，我变了，变的只是距离。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">第二步：让它有吸引力。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">把想做的事和喜欢做的事绑在一起。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">克利尔叫它&quot;习惯叠加&quot;——<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">在现有习惯后面，接上新习惯。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">比如：每天早上泡完咖啡之后（现有习惯），读 10 分钟书（新习惯）。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">咖啡是你喜欢的，读书是你想要的，两者一绑定，启动阻力几乎为零。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">第三步：让它简单易行。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">两分钟法则</strong>：任何新习惯，缩减到两分钟以内就能开始。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">&quot;每天健身一小时&quot;→&quot;每天穿上运动鞋&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">&quot;每天读一本书&quot;→&quot;每天翻开书读一页&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">&quot;每天冥想20分钟&quot;→&quot;每天闭上眼睛深呼吸三次&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">听起来很敷衍对吧？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">但克利尔的核心观点是：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">你要先成为做这件事的人，再优化这件事怎么做。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 先建立&quot;我是一个跑步的人&quot;的身份认同，再去纠结跑 5 公里还是 10 公里。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">第四步：让它令人满足。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">给自己即时反馈。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">打卡日历、进度条、存钱罐——<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">让大脑立刻知道&quot;我做对了&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">人类的大脑天生追求即时满足。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你刷短视频能停不下来，就是因为每一条都在给你即时奖励。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">而读书、健身这些长期有益的事，奖励太延迟了，大脑等不及。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">所以你要人为地制造即时满足感。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; \"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">03 别问&quot;我想得到什么&quot;，问&quot;我想成为谁&quot;</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这本书最打动我的，不是那些技巧，而是一个关于身份认同的观点。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">克利尔说，大多数人在改变习惯的时候，目标定反了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">你的目标不应该是&quot;我想瘦 10 斤&quot;，而是&quot;我想成为一个健康的人&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 不是&quot;我想读完这本书&quot;，而是&quot;我想成为一个爱读书的人&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">不是&quot;我想戒烟&quot;，而是&quot;我不想做一个吸烟的人&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">听起来像文字游戏？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">不是的。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">当你把自己定义为&quot;一个正在减肥的人&quot;，你潜意识里还是那个胖子，只是在努力摆脱他。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">但当你把自己定义为&quot;一个健康的人&quot;，你的每一个选择都会从这个身份出发——健康的人吃什么、做什么、不做什么，答案自然就出来了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">习惯不是你做了什么，习惯是你成为了谁。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">我之前一直觉得自己&quot;不是早起的人&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">后来有一天我换了个说法：我是一个&quot;早起有精力的人&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">就这一句话的改变，我早上闹钟响了之后，不再纠结&quot;要不要再睡五分钟&quot;，而是直接起来了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">因为早起的人，就是会起来的。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">没什么好纠结的。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">读完这本书，我做了一件事：把&quot;每天进步 1%&quot;写在便利贴上，贴在了电脑屏幕的右上角。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">每天看到它，就提醒自己——<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">今天不需要做很多，只需要比昨天好一点点。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">日拱一卒，功不唐捐。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">书灯笔记，用一本书，点亮一盏灯。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">我是马尔斯，我们下期见。</p>\n</section>\n</div>",
      "author": "马尔斯",
      "digest": "不是你意志力不够，是你用错了方法。《掌控习惯》告诉你：每天进步1%，一年后你会变成1.37倍。习惯不是你做了什么，是你成为了谁。",
      "need_open_comment": 1,
      "only_fans_can_comment": 0
    }
  ]
}